<p>The Westin Palace has a grand entrance directly on Plaza de las Cortes where cars can stop right at the door under cover. Given the hotel's size, there is a steady flow of guests arriving and departing, so drivers are used to identifying the correct passenger quickly when a name or booking reference is confirmed in advance.</p>
